1
00:00:00,559 --> 00:00:03,700
This is Tamagotchi: ten rare pets to find,

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,119
tame and take care of.

3
00:00:05,119 --> 00:00:06,699
Here is every feature,

4
00:00:06,699 --> 00:00:08,429
with the real game sounds.

5
00:00:09,722 --> 00:00:12,382
The pets hide in structures: a dragon

6
00:00:12,382 --> 00:00:13,952
in the desert pyramid,

7
00:00:14,242 --> 00:00:15,802
a penguin in an igloo,

8
00:00:15,802 --> 00:00:17,022
and a living treasure chest

9
00:00:17,022 --> 00:00:18,572
in trial chambers.

10
00:00:20,656 --> 00:00:22,756
Give a wild pet a Tamagotchi Heart,

11
00:00:22,756 --> 00:00:24,426
and it trusts you.

12
00:00:26,677 --> 00:00:28,177
Pet it with an empty hand,

13
00:00:28,177 --> 00:00:30,347
and it shows you heart eyes.

14
00:00:32,795 --> 00:00:36,335
Every pet has four needs: hunger, fun,

15
00:00:36,335 --> 00:00:37,585
energy and hygiene.

16
00:00:38,135 --> 00:00:40,695
The Tama Pager tells it to stay or follow,

17
00:00:40,695 --> 00:00:42,685
and it beeps when a pet needs you.

18
00:00:43,970 --> 00:00:45,930
Pets eat from the food bowl,

19
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:47,980
and they splash around in the bath.

20
00:00:49,774 --> 00:00:51,054
They snore in their beds,

21
00:00:51,054 --> 00:00:53,164
and they love a good brushing.

22
00:00:55,857 --> 00:00:57,437
They chase the laser pointer,

23
00:00:57,437 --> 00:00:58,997
jump at the feather wand,

24
00:00:58,997 --> 00:01:01,007
and fetch the squeaky ball.

25
00:01:05,338 --> 00:01:07,148
They bounce on the mushroom,

26
00:01:07,318 --> 00:01:08,798
run in the running wheel,

27
00:01:08,798 --> 00:01:09,618
and sharpen their claws

28
00:01:09,618 --> 00:01:11,348
on the scratching post.

29
00:01:13,973 --> 00:01:16,083
A chest becomes a backpack.

30
00:01:16,433 --> 00:01:17,713
Put golden apples inside,

31
00:01:17,713 --> 00:01:19,193
and when you are hurt,

32
00:01:19,193 --> 00:01:20,763
your pet brings you one.

33
00:01:23,291 --> 00:01:25,221
Every pet has a talent:

34
00:01:25,591 --> 00:01:27,771
the Desert Dragon roasts food,

35
00:01:27,771 --> 00:01:29,811
the Pebble Golem finds ores,

36
00:01:29,811 --> 00:01:31,571
the penguin freezes water,

37
00:01:31,571 --> 00:01:33,781
and the Ember Pup swims in lava.

38
00:01:35,848 --> 00:01:38,648
Dragons fly after you, and in a fight,

39
00:01:38,648 --> 00:01:40,098
your pets have your back.

40
00:01:41,838 --> 00:01:43,478
And they never die.

41
00:01:43,478 --> 00:01:45,408
They faint into an egg instead.

42
00:01:47,642 --> 00:01:49,462
New in this update: plushies

43
00:01:49,462 --> 00:01:50,782
of all ten pets.

44
00:01:50,782 --> 00:01:51,752
Squeeze them!

45
00:01:54,092 --> 00:01:56,012
Lonely pets cuddle them,

46
00:01:56,012 --> 00:01:57,532
and a pet sleeps better next

47
00:01:57,532 --> 00:01:59,502
to a plush of its own kind.

48
00:02:01,799 --> 00:02:03,959
Put a Tama Egg into the incubator,

49
00:02:03,959 --> 00:02:06,519
and thirty seconds later your pet hatches,

50
00:02:06,519 --> 00:02:07,990
fully healed.

51
00:02:11,042 --> 00:02:12,382
Press a button,

52
00:02:12,382 --> 00:02:14,102
and the treat dispenser shoots a treat

53
00:02:14,102 --> 00:02:15,752
to your hungriest pet.

54
00:02:18,704 --> 00:02:20,424
Bored pets open the toy box

55
00:02:20,424 --> 00:02:22,654
and play with the toys inside.

56
00:02:25,330 --> 00:02:27,630
And the pet flap lets your pets through,

57
00:02:27,630 --> 00:02:29,000
but nobody else.

58
00:02:32,028 --> 00:02:33,988
The portrait paints your nearest pet,

59
00:02:33,988 --> 00:02:35,718
with its name on the plate.

60
00:02:36,108 --> 00:02:37,248
Click again for the next pet,

61
00:02:37,248 --> 00:02:39,489
or use a dye.

62
00:02:40,899 --> 00:02:43,259
The egg lamp is a little night light,

63
00:02:43,259 --> 00:02:44,659
and beds, baskets,

64
00:02:44,659 --> 00:02:46,809
lamps and portraits take any dye.

65
00:02:49,363 --> 00:02:50,823
Pets dance to music

66
00:02:50,823 --> 00:02:52,953
and warm up at the campfire.

67
00:02:55,319 --> 00:02:57,279
And if you forget something,

68
00:02:57,279 --> 00:02:58,599
just read the Tamacon,

69
00:02:58,599 --> 00:03:00,649
your little guide to everything.

70
00:03:02,335 --> 00:03:05,125
That's Tamagotchi. Thanks for watching!

